
### 1. Create a return request (older purchase date)
POST http://localhost:8081/returns
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "Aarya",
    "productName": "Bluetooth Speaker",
    "reason": "Changed my mind",
    "status": "REQUESTED",
    "purchaseDate": "2026-10-20"
}

###

### 2. Get all return requests
GET http://localhost:8081/returns

###

### 3. Check eligibility for existing request ID 3
GET http://localhost:8081/returns/3/eligibility

###

### 4. Create a new eligible return request
POST http://localhost:8081/returns
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "Aarya",
    "productName": "Wireless Mouse",
    "reason": "Wrong product",
    "status": "REQUESTED",
    "purchaseDate": "2026-11-05"
}

###

### 5. Update return request status
PUT http://localhost:8081/returns/3/status
Content-Type: text/plain

APPROVED
###
### 6. Check eligibility for Wireless Mouse
GET http://localhost:8081/returns/6/eligibility